.claude/skills/coordinator/references/skill-rewrite.md:25:     The item takes the form of a landed item in `SKILL.md`, "Pages". It shows the change against the skill's text before it, or, for an approved draft whose words changed at the landing, against the approved words. It gives the change's reason, which may come from a cold read, a hit of the skills' lint, `explorations/coordinator/tools/skills-lint.py`, or the record entry that the orientation workflow, in update mode, took in. The reason says in plain words what was wrong and what the text now says. It never cites a cold read's flag by its code or number, a judge's ruling by its number, or an item of a task by its number.
